Z||000007||tgowens||05-23-2001||05:55 PM||||FieroHarry, I am only involved in the web design end of it but I would suggest that you address it with your local club President (if you are a member of a club) or through the appropriate FOCOA Regional Director - A lot of people are really confused (I was) as to the fact that the club and the business are two different things and basically run by different people. I think the confusion will be cleared up in the near future though.<P>The Director for your region may be reached by email at  <A HREF="mailto:captfiero@aol.com">captfiero@aol.com</A> <P>I hope this helps.........||||reg||1
